//   stage and balance rules (lines 43-63), copied verbatim; EF queries become in-memory lists, persistence and the
//   view projection are left out. Also verbatim: Domain/Enums.cs, Domain/HrisRules.cs, IVersioned + HrisError
//   (Domain/WorkshopModels.cs), Actor (Security/HrisAuth.cs:9), PtoInput + DecisionInput (Contracts/WorkshopContracts.cs:10-11).
